Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Directors: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Four Years Ago{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Episode 3{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We own this entire orchard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I thought my mom would be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Maybe she's at the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.62,0:01:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}She runs a store too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I told you our family was\Ninfluential in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Yongdu-ri Supermarket{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not here, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a new flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.19,0:02:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Ice Pop{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strawberry flavored.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.94,0:02:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All the kids buy one after\Nschool, since it's so popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good and refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your first time having an ice pop?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.64,0:03:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. Maybe not as an adult, but as a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your mom never buy you one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.49,0:03:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I kind of knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Knew what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You always wear t-shirts with holes in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's vintage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- I got them made in Europe...\N- What you're wearing today looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,something my grandma would wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No, hear me out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be shocked to find out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.39,0:03:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the price of this cardigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.15,0:03:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- You don't have to pretend with me.\N- Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not that poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.53,0:04:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You should trust me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.11,0:04:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I give you my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.49,0:04:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,From this moment on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.58,0:04:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you enjoy all the\Nthings you couldn't enjoy in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.54,0:04:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you my apartment was leased?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I save $2000 every month.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me like you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not bragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.49,0:04:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if your family has debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:04:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If we have debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if there's more than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.59,0:05:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.19,0:05:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why did this memory pop up?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Would you be the last person on my mind...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}if I died right now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.19,0:06:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you wrap up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.77,0:06:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks startled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.37,0:06:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It felt surreal at the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.05,0:07:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but I really thought I'd die back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I told myself again...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,that I'd never die,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,because I felt...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you sprained it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.14,0:07:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I being dramatic again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, if this was any other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but since I'm injured,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.94,0:08:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it easy to set wood on fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is oak,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- so is it impossible?\N- No, it's not,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.59,0:08:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but campers like me prefer plum tree to oak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The burning smell of plum seeps\Ninto the meat and makes it tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Go on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, this makes me nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm reminded of when I went to Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.27,0:08:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My twenties were filled\Nwith wildness and barbarism.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean how you stayed...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.70,0:09:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,in the hotel the whole\Nweek due to the mosquitoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I had enough of the wilderness\Njust looking out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.63,0:09:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's only smoke.\N- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this wood is damp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the most skilled campers\Ncan't do anything about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo was never picky about wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's from the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't compare me to him who probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,played soccer on unpaved roads with pig bladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He has experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.73,0:09:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, you and your excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.15,0:09:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You can stop. Just ask him to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol, that's enough. You can stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.23,0:10:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Chamomile?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you make two more for the chairman and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Father return early instead of hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.12,0:10:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The great shaman contacted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The shaman suddenly asked if\Nthe chairman had gone hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- How did she know?\N- No wonder she's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She said the chairman would be\Nin danger if he went hunting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why he came back right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but at least it's good news for Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.97,0:10:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She got to take his course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.65,0:10:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in got injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.61,0:10:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard she met a boar while hunting,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.11,0:11:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but her injuries aren't\Nthat bad. They're not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness. Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.09,0:11:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, thank you so much.\NI'll visit you sometime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.26,0:11:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.85,0:11:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ex-wife appeared in her dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She was holding a knife at a hunting ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She wanted to take you with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.40,0:11:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You could've been in grave\Ndanger if you'd hunted today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.36,0:11:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.41,0:11:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You were wise to listen to me and return.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore superstitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.79,0:11:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Check in with the shaman\Nbefore making big decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we call Doctor Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay. I just sprained it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he couldn't even\Nshoot a bird, but a boar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He was pretending all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably has experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.03,0:12:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just compliment him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.78,0:12:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You need a lot of experience to catch one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.16,0:12:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Boar are thick-skinned, so\Nyou need to hit the right spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, it could be even more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Thank God he was\Nlucky. What if he missed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.42,0:12:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't have been so reckless as a rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a marine in the special guard team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- He was known for his shooting.\N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.85,0:12:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you finally understand\Nhow much of a fool you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.31,0:12:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,to offer to teach him how to shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing is for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be here right now\Nif he'd hesitated even a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You lucky brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- I could tell by his muscular arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.33,0:13:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that he didn't spend all\Nhis years only studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was in jail,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.67,0:13:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,he handed me the agreement\Nwith those muscular arms,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and said, "Please sign this,"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and my heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,fluttered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Aunt.\N- Aunt, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You amaze me at times, Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How did you make that\Ndecision in that brief moment?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.94,0:13:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It was instinctive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your instincts knew you shouldn't let her die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You had to save her so she'd\Nrevise her will. Right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She took some meds and went to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She must've been so startled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.07,0:14:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I scanned the course earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.36,0:14:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed the fence was pried open.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe the injured boar\Nhad entered through that hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That was supposed to be Chairman Hong's course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying someone purposely\Nlured the injured boar to harm him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't know, even if that was the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.55,0:14:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll check the nearby CCTV cameras and dashcams.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll check them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.89,0:15:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll get them ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.81,0:15:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.35,0:15:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,this had to happen during your visit, Mr. Yoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.07,0:15:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoon, try the soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.03,0:15:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught that pheasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Don't lie, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We bought them at a nearby farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you season the bellflower roots?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo prefers them charbroiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:16:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I like this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.83,0:16:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,These are lacquer leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.59,0:16:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pretty rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The mountain-bred ones are\Nvery tasty and hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I had them when I was younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"Younger"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.27,0:16:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you grow up in the U.S.?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I went there when I was 13 years\Nold. I was in Korea up until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your family immigrate there\Nor were you studying abroad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.40,0:16:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I was adopted overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.03,0:16:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My adoptive parents passed away\Nright before I graduated college,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,so I have no family now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost my parents at 15,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.71,0:16:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and I came this far by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't aware of your family history.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're unlike today's young generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.97,0:16:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you like I'm your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.09,0:17:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to consider us your Korean family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.57,0:17:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here. Yes, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.61,0:17:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he a Pungsan dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a handsome one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only is he handsome,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but he saved my son years\Nback when our house was on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.54,0:17:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is that true?\N- Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My son was home alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He would've lost his life if\Nour dog hadn't awakened him...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.05,0:17:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and dragged him outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.93,0:17:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's intelligent and loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to sell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.35,0:17:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll give you $100,000.\N- Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But he doesn't even have a pedigree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll offer less with time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,$90,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- $80,000.\N- Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.07,0:18:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sell him,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.07,0:18:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,could you give us $100,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing I don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's prejudice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about Mr. Yoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he seem too laid back for\Nsomeone who's gone through so much in life?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He must've worked hard to make up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.03,0:19:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't judge a book by its cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can never know what\Nsomeone's thinking deep down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're from the U.S.?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.87,0:19:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You know our language and\NKorean proverbs better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.54,0:19:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My father made us only speak\NKorean and read Korean books at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.79,0:19:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What a wise man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not everyone can become an Ivy League professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like some?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.85,0:19:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Even beer is too bitter for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.73,0:19:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I feel terrible that\NI can't be your drinking buddy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:19:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Don't feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I need the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so chatty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your room is the very last\None on the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.02,0:20:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a lovely night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.11,0:20:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.91,0:20:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked me for advice last time...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.99,0:20:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,on how to get on the KFTC members' good side...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.79,0:20:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,when they summoned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.21,0:20:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.71,0:21:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want some detailed tips right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.55,0:21:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on the legal expertise I obtained\Nduring my law school days at SNU,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and years of working at the legal team,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I could offer an extensive\Nyet simple explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.69,0:21:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free until late into the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not. My wife is waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.40,0:21:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.32,0:21:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's a shame for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a great opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.71,0:21:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleeping in the same room as Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.35,0:21:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.48,0:21:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.69,0:22:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.81,0:22:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I be afraid of\Nsleeping next to my wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? Your room is up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.29,0:22:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.92,0:22:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I truly...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.01,0:22:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,pity him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.86,0:22:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where's the alcohol?\N- What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.65,0:22:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You drank it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.99,0:22:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.11,0:22:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you already drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.07,0:22:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.87,0:22:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go to bed.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.25,0:23:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I drank it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.54,0:23:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.00,0:23:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.34,0:23:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.84,0:23:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.80,0:23:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.43,0:23:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol asked me something,\Nso we were talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.47,0:23:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.27,0:24:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.68,0:24:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he pestering you at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.06,0:24:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey. Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.11,0:24:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't be so hot-tempered.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.49,0:24:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I go back out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.99,0:24:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and give him a stern warning?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.70,0:24:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.79,0:24:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.54,0:24:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help me take off my top.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.42,0:24:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I sprained my fingers.\NIt hurts to unbutton it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.92,0:24:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.80,0:24:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Me?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.01,0:24:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Unbutton you?\N- Yes, back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.31,0:24:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.99,0:24:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.58,0:25:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.54,0:25:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.67,0:25:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.68,0:25:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you undressing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.09,0:25:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.10,0:25:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not showering?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.31,0:25:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.66,0:25:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.47,0:26:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't glamorize him. He wasn't that handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.70,0:26:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Are you okay?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.78,0:26:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.74,0:26:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't replay it in slow motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.88,0:26:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.09,0:26:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.64,0:26:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't find...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.52,0:26:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,a bathrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.53,0:26:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.36,0:27:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.29,0:27:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so dumbfounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.29,0:27:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he think...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.80,0:27:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,he's sexy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.34,0:28:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world happened to his body?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.64,0:28:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.07,0:28:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.12,0:28:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.79,0:28:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of water on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.33,0:28:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like that, so I was going to wipe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.38,0:28:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.09,0:28:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go dry your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.22,0:28:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.26,0:28:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,you didn't dry your hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.43,0:28:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,because you looked in the mirror...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.60,0:28:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and thought you looked like...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.31,0:28:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,a drenched Timothée Chalamet\Nor a young Leonardo DiCaprio.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.28,0:29:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's not why,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.86,0:29:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,then go dry your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.78,0:29:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.49,0:29:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.17,0:29:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.59,0:29:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he trying to seduce me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.55,0:29:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too stimulated...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.80,0:29:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,for this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.62,0:29:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.17,0:30:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The bed is small.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.46,0:30:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this queen-sized?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.92,0:30:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's king.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.43,0:30:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels too small...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.39,0:30:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,to be king-sized.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.68,0:30:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a time...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.60,0:30:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,when we slept together...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.98,0:30:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,on a single bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.31,0:30:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.57,0:30:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.74,0:30:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My first visit to Yongdu-ri.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.53,0:30:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Certificate of Award\NDiligence Award{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.39,0:30:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Spend the night here.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.32,0:31:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}It's too late.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.83,0:31:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}It's 9 p.m.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.41,0:31:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}That's pretty late.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.16,0:31:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- It's dangerous to drive at night.\N- That's true.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.17,0:31:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Right.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.96,0:31:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sleep here.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.13,0:31:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'll be in that room.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.05,0:31:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'll be there...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.64,0:31:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}if you need me.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.27,0:31:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Good night, then.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.78,0:32:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}The moon looked pretty.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.53,0:32:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Maybe we could look at it together.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.16,0:32:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Come in...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.17,0:32:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}if you want.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.28,0:33:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- By the way...\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.28,0:33:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How did we even sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.41,0:33:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,on that bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.25,0:33:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We cuddled.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.42,0:33:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.04,0:33:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we cuddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.05,0:33:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to cuddle if the bed is too small?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.39,0:33:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.47,0:33:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.39,0:33:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have some room.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.40,0:33:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.23,0:33:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.90,0:33:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,do you want to cuddle...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.24,0:33:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,nonetheless?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.42,0:34:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.88,0:34:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.60,0:35:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.23,0:35:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.39,0:35:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.10,0:35:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't in my right mind yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.23,0:35:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to give this back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.48,0:35:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help us. We couldn't sleep last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.91,0:35:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I already gifted the dog\Nto him, so I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.91,0:35:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.66,0:35:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He's family to us, since he saved our son.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.50,0:35:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I must've been insane to have sold him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.38,0:35:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.92,0:35:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you.\N- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.88,0:35:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.88,0:35:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.05,0:35:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.93,0:35:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You felt guilty for selling him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.26,0:35:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's just kill him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.43,0:35:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Would that be better?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.27,0:35:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.70,0:36:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, I almost shot you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.62,0:36:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.87,0:36:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.13,0:36:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that a joke to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.71,0:36:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.72,0:36:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you return the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.97,0:36:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.18,0:36:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.22,0:36:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The deal has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.69,0:36:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You may go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.28,0:36:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.24,0:36:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.65,0:36:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hurry.\N- By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.66,0:36:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,why can't I kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.53,0:36:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.91,0:36:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He doted on the dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.66,0:36:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The dog is like family.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.21,0:36:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, is it okay to\Nkill abandoned or stray dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.36,0:37:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the entrance to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.74,0:37:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else entered except for our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.53,0:37:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean this was an inside job?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.37,0:37:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.88,0:37:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.80,0:37:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.89,0:37:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only see his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.43,0:37:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.02,0:37:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.06,0:37:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.40,0:38:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.61,0:38:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-seok wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.90,0:38:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Find out if he's still in Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.24,0:38:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.40,0:38:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pack up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.70,0:38:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Already?\N- The day is ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.28,0:38:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.70,0:38:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Honey, do you remember that boy?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.91,0:38:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened over two decades ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.67,0:38:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That incident where the German\NShepherd of a brewery died,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.21,0:38:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and the killer turned out to be a little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.19,0:38:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, the one from the\NEvergreen Hope Orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.01,0:38:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He received a scholarship from\NQueens Group because he was so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.89,0:38:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I fed him several times when he visited.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.43,0:38:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.52,0:38:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Remember what he said to the police?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.44,0:38:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}This is you, isn't it?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.40,0:38:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Why would you kill someone's precious dog?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.86,0:38:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I won't let this pass.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.57,0:38:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Do you know how much he cost?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.24,0:38:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm sorry.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.78,0:38:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Apologize to him this instant.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.49,0:38:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}What makes a precious dog any different?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.17,0:39:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Then would it be okay to kill...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.67,0:39:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}a normal dog?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.09,0:39:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}What's wrong with that kid?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.09,0:39:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Gosh, what's he saying?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.47,0:39:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gosh, you're right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.76,0:39:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He did ask that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.89,0:39:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It was creepy to hear a boy say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.26,0:39:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Didn't he look like him?\N- Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.35,0:40:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's me. Did you get home safely?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.02,0:40:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I booked you a meeting with Mr. Hermann.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.94,0:40:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.40,0:40:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.57,0:40:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, see you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.61,0:40:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.50,0:40:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}All Mail{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.31,0:40:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}We apologize...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.36,0:40:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.11,0:40:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.20,0:40:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When Hercyna is just around the corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.70,0:40:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm this close to the One Billion Club?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.33,0:41:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.37,0:41:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have so many limited-editions\NI haven't worn yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.83,0:41:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought so many islands,\Nbut haven't visited them yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.17,0:41:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet I'm going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.05,0:41:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that'd be such a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.10,0:41:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought all these from artists...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.93,0:41:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,in their 90s, because\Nposthumous works skyrocket,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.44,0:41:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,so how could I die before them?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.78,0:41:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be such a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.92,0:41:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be the biggest waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.39,0:42:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's wrap up this store's contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.31,0:42:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.29,0:43:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Secretary Na.\N- Yes, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.88,0:43:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there women whose hearts still\Nrace when they see their husbands,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.59,0:43:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,despite being married for over three years?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.80,0:43:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would their hearts race?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.97,0:43:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do they have arrhythmia?\N- No, not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.35,0:43:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.02,0:43:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,because...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.81,0:43:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,they're handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.48,0:43:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Their husbands?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.81,0:43:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.65,0:43:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know someone like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.07,0:43:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.36,0:43:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,On some days, she looks him in the eye...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.54,0:43:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and wants to embrace him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.58,0:43:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.67,0:43:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because she pities him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.79,0:43:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She feels bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.84,0:44:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that such a soft soul has\Nto endure this harsh world.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.59,0:44:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- No way.\N- On other days,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.76,0:44:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,his shoulders look...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.89,0:44:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,so broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.72,0:44:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She wants him to hold her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.43,0:44:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks like a walking, sexy dynamite.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.48,0:44:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She wonders if she should let the {\i1}homme fatal...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.36,0:44:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,roam freely in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.44,0:44:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell her to see a doctor. She's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.70,0:44:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you think so?\N- I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.49,0:44:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure she gets a brain CT scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.45,0:44:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's seriously wrong up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.33,0:44:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Secretary Na.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.71,0:44:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.96,0:44:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- I've been very strange these days.\N- How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.76,0:44:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel sympathy...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.09,0:44:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,for others.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.14,0:44:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is that strange?\N- I was never like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.22,0:44:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always been cold-hearted,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.10,0:44:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.90,0:44:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}You're so noisy.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.40,0:45:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Stop crying when I'm sacrificing my arm for you.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.53,0:45:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And I keep empathizing...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.49,0:45:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.71,0:45:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}What was that?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.71,0:45:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Solicitors aren't allowed here.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.55,0:45:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm sorry. He's my acquaintance's husband.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.68,0:45:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}So you're doing him a favor?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.55,0:45:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Their baby is in an incubator.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.26,0:45:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I felt bad, so...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.35,0:45:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}He won't return.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.35,0:45:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- I'm sorry.\N- How long does the baby...?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.56,0:45:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sorry?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.89,0:45:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}...have to be in there?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.94,0:45:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- About three...\N- Forget it. One week? Two?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.36,0:45:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'll only let him come by until then.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.03,0:45:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}You'll let him do that?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.20,0:45:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'd better not see him\Nonce his baby is discharged.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.91,0:45:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}No insurance will cover it.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.20,0:45:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I wanted to use our security\Ndeposit for her surgery,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.58,0:45:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}but my mom won't listen.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.96,0:45:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}She says it's my wedding money.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.00,0:46:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Money is always the problem.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.46,0:46:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm sorry.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.06,0:46:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Unbelievable.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.35,0:46:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Her mom isn't the only one who's sick.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.56,0:46:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Her mom can get treated,\Nso why would she cry...?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.70,0:46:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Why are there so many sick people?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.62,0:46:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}How annoying.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.33,0:46:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I was never like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.00,0:46:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I never cared...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.04,0:46:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,about people's pain, so why am I like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.13,0:46:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband makes my heart race.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.38,0:46:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe my brain isn't functioning properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.64,0:46:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these symptoms of my illness?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.60,0:46:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.22,0:47:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Many terminally-ill patients\Nexperience such changes of heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.02,0:47:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They realize things they\Nwouldn't have realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.27,0:47:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,if they weren't dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.57,0:47:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"You're changing because of death."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.53,0:47:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"You're going to die soon."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.99,0:47:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's what you're insinuating,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.41,0:47:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.91,0:47:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I've been on the\Nbrink of death many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.99,0:47:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and my miraculous luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.29,0:47:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,saved me every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.30,0:47:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not skilled enough to save me,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.01,0:47:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,then just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.72,0:47:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Another miracle...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.06,0:47:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,will save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.27,0:47:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.82,0:47:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.24,0:47:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I went to the hunting ground! So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.06,0:47:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.12,0:47:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To see Father. He's there\Naround this time of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.16,0:47:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But you left without seeing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.25,0:48:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.54,0:48:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,suspecting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.58,0:48:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The fence was pried open\Nand there was bait nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.13,0:48:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the boar that'd been shot attacked Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.63,0:48:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Someone purposely...\N- So?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.68,0:48:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter almost died.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.43,0:48:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.81,0:48:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.06,0:48:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're upset because Hae-in was involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.65,0:48:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why weren't you upset when I was\Nfalsely accused and kicked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.32,0:48:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.07,0:48:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I went there because I knew\Nit was the family's hunting day,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.91,0:48:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but when I went there,\Nthe great Moh Seul-hee said...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.42,0:48:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,he was asleep and didn't let me see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.63,0:48:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I begged her, but to no avail,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.13,0:48:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so I came back. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.47,0:48:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.09,0:48:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-jun.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.76,0:48:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me meet him just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.39,0:49:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I need. I want to\Nreconcile before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.10,0:49:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.60,0:49:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it's better to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.79,0:49:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.75,0:49:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't my family so odd?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.63,0:49:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry? Not at all, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.71,0:49:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We have seven lawsuits against each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.47,0:49:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You must've walked on\Neggshells as you took care...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.55,0:49:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,of our trivial matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.31,0:49:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.86,0:49:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.99,0:50:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The chairman is already asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.24,0:50:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.87,0:50:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I wake him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.41,0:50:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.54,0:50:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I just came by to greet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.58,0:50:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.59,0:50:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Moh.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.84,0:50:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Beom-seok come to our hunting ground...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.85,0:50:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and ask to see Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.31,0:50:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.98,0:50:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.61,0:50:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.48,0:50:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like saying this,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.15,0:50:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but be wary of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.57,0:50:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been holding a grudge for\Na while after getting kicked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.28,0:50:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who have nothing\Nto lose are the most fearful.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.13,0:50:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of person is\NMr. Yoon Eun-sung? Do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.30,0:50:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.51,0:51:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know his business side,\Nbut not him as a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.89,0:51:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You know people like us\Nshouldn't trust others easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.64,0:51:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If this deal goes down the drain too,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.60,0:51:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Father will abandon Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.40,0:51:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.48,0:51:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look into him discreetly.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.02,0:51:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.23,0:51:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, you startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.70,0:52:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A background check?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.83,0:52:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She's quite cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.29,0:52:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just afraid,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.66,0:52:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's only in the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.08,0:52:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,People like her trust easily\Nonce they let down their guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.34,0:52:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She did let down her guard somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.67,0:52:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, do you see any hope with Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.43,0:52:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Money is important to me for sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.10,0:52:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'd also love to see that couple break up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.39,0:52:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.39,0:52:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safe to say I pioneered the\Nmatchmaking scene in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.86,0:52:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet I failed to properly\Nmarry off Queens' daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.69,0:52:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How humiliating is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.49,0:52:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tear them apart at all costs,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.78,0:52:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and retrieve my lost honor and performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.70,0:52:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, don't repeat what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.50,0:52:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- You'll get in the way.\N- That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.71,0:52:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.25,0:53:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but Hyun-woo stepped in, killed the boar,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.17,0:53:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and saved Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.26,0:53:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I never saw that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.80,0:53:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hyun-woo, you've leveled up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.76,0:53:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,From Mr. Cinderella who\Nmarried into a wealthy family,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.14,0:53:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to a lifesaver who saved their daughter's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.98,0:53:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're treating me differently now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.98,0:53:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my first time eating a pheasant leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.48,0:53:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I was normally given the neck or the lean cuts,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.24,0:53:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but my father-in-law gave me the leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.41,0:53:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too early to be complacent.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.04,0:53:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up the good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.37,0:53:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.46,0:53:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"I was only doing my job."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.42,0:53:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ruin this opportunity\Nby talking such nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.42,0:53:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yes, I was scared too. I could've\Ndied, but I did it for Hae-in."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.01,0:53:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to take credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.64,0:53:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do I have to?\N- Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.18,0:53:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking credit is like collecting coffee coupons.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.06,0:53:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to collect ten coupons...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.44,0:54:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,for them to realize you're a\Nregular and give you freebies.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.44,0:54:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.32,0:54:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,any freebies.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.40,0:54:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All I want is to be free and unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.28,0:54:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.16,0:54:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye if you're going...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.74,0:54:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- to be fake.\N- Goodbye to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.12,0:54:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"Goodbye, my Italian suits."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.96,0:54:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,"Goodbye, my handmade designer shoes."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.83,0:54:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"Goodbye, my foreign car."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.08,0:54:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"Goodbye, the luxury watch on my wrist."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.50,0:54:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"Goodbye, Hae-in's fortune."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.13,0:54:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Cinderella will now return\Nto his orchard down south,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.01,0:54:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but the problem is, his family\Nwon't welcome him with open arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.14,0:54:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.98,0:54:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My son isn't interested in boxing\Nand wants to do Taekwondo instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.57,0:54:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay. Kids are like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.53,0:54:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.74,0:54:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.91,0:54:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Jae-hyeon,\Nwhy do you like Taekwondo?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.24,0:54:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They have belts.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.62,0:54:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Belts? For your waist?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.16,0:54:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.91,0:55:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he wants to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.46,0:55:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Jae-hyeon, we have belts too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.17,0:55:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.30,0:55:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the champion belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.59,0:55:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.18,0:55:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ta-da.\N- Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.43,0:55:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.51,0:55:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say? Isn't it\Nfancier than those belts?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.81,0:55:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They smash things too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.10,0:55:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Smash?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.56,0:55:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We smash things too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.90,0:55:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We just didn't have time. Should I show you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.65,0:55:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you don't need to show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.28,0:55:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.28,0:55:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.65,0:55:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the board?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.95,0:55:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.87,0:55:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.95,0:55:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.00,0:55:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.59,0:55:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll smash it this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.30,0:55:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.68,0:55:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.35,0:56:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I smashed it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.44,0:56:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Isn't boxing cool too?\N- But...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.81,0:56:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What is it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.48,0:56:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to do Taekwondo because Ji-seong does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.15,0:56:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ji-seong is his best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.57,0:56:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.87,0:56:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only saying this because\NI care a lot about Jae-hyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.79,0:56:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think he should have various friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.98,0:56:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.04,0:56:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you know Baek Ho-yeol?\N- I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.84,0:56:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my son, and he's just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.38,0:56:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He loves games, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.51,0:56:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How great would it be to come here to box...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.35,0:56:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and play games with him after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.23,0:56:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ho-yeol has the lowest grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.81,0:56:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.11,0:56:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.73,0:56:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.11,0:56:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.74,0:56:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.37,0:56:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.41,0:56:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The wood must've scraped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.24,0:57:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.79,0:57:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.87,0:57:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go.\N- Get home safely, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.96,0:57:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.38,0:57:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.58,0:57:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Jae-hyeon, see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.25,0:57:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.34,0:57:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.86,0:57:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, you're bleeding.\N- It's just a scrape.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.82,0:57:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The wood scraped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.19,0:57:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so irritated?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.07,0:57:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't been getting much sleep lately,\Nso I closed down my salon today.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.87,0:57:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I should close down this gym soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.70,0:57:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and consider working under\Nsomeone once Hyun-woo divorces.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.25,0:57:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking about his divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.96,0:57:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I should accept reality and prepare myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.00,0:57:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Should we go to Seoul?\N- And do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.01,0:57:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I called Hae-in, but she didn't pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.30,0:57:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's meet her in person and\Ndissuade her from getting a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.18,0:57:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get ready.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.64,0:58:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.97,0:58:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so against this whole plan,\Nbut I guess you eventually got into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.06,0:58:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.15,0:58:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I always do my best when\NI set my mind to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.57,0:58:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.65,0:58:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You always do things wholeheartedly,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.57,0:58:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but here's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.11,0:58:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool her halfheartedly, and all will be fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.91,0:58:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but do an outstanding job,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.79,0:58:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and she'll be livid if she finds out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.42,0:58:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Probably, right?\N- Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.75,0:58:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,so you should never get caught. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.80,0:58:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't get caught,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.13,0:58:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as we...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.14,0:58:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,keep this a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.51,0:58:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.35,0:58:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, shouldn't we tell\NHyun-woo we're going to see Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.65,0:58:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.73,0:58:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he'll allow that?\NWe have nothing to lose now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.48,0:58:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We should try to stop them at all costs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.45,0:58:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.04,0:59:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Ongoing Recruitment{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.43,0:59:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.89,0:59:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need to introduce ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.27,0:59:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you watch dramas?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.14,0:59:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The secretary's office manages the VIP families.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.19,0:59:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be startled the moment\Nthey see our faces and say,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.78,0:59:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ms. Hong, your sister-in-law is here."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.03,0:59:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they'll let us in right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.95,0:59:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to book an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.41,0:59:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be new here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.01,0:59:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.22,1:00:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.59,1:00:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This wavy-haired guy is him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.14,1:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? That's us. See?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.64,1:00:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave your name and number,\Nand I'll hand it to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.73,1:00:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.65,1:00:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're her family. We're\Npart of the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.73,1:00:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must we book an\Nappointment to see our family?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.69,1:00:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.99,1:00:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please book an appointment and come back...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.91,1:00:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.04,1:00:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.96,1:00:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Hyeon-tae, Hyun-woo's brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.75,1:00:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.50,1:00:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered if it was you, and I was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.09,1:00:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to talk. Even Hyun-woo\Ndoesn't know we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.84,1:00:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.26,1:00:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we go upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.85,1:00:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.44,1:00:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- This way.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.94,1:01:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.24,1:01:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But you see, we won't punish\Nyou for not recognizing us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.78,1:01:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.87,1:01:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't abuse our power in that manner.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.76,1:01:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.93,1:01:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry we came by unannounced.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.39,1:01:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd actually called several times,\Nbut I couldn't reach you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.14,1:01:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't pick up unsaved numbers.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.89,1:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not have my number.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.35,1:01:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.81,1:01:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.19,1:01:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where should I begin?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.53,1:01:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It was our dad's 60th birthday recently.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.87,1:01:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be here because you\Nwere upset that I didn't show up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.40,1:01:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.45,1:01:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.47,1:01:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not, because we weren't upset at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.00,1:02:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you'll feel about this,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.01,1:02:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but Hyun-woo...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.43,1:02:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes?\N- He's difficult, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.76,1:02:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sorry?\N- Gosh, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.05,1:02:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand what?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.14,1:02:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The person who's the polar opposite of\Nyou isn't on the other side of the globe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.02,1:02:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the person you're married to,\Nthe one you sleep and eat next to.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.19,1:02:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They fail to understand you the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.09,1:02:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.15,1:02:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband and I argued\Nall the time because of the AC.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.95,1:02:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd turn on the AC in the\Nsummer, and I'd be freezing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.74,1:02:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We even cursed each other out because of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.83,1:02:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He used to be head-over-heels\Nfor me when we got married,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.75,1:02:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,yet he couldn't even turn off the AC for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.96,1:02:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't argue over such things.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.96,1:02:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.80,1:02:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.18,1:02:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a good relationship.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.72,1:02:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We sleep in separate rooms,\Nso we each have an AC.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.39,1:02:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's understandable if\Nyou have many spare rooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.85,1:03:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is what I say to him all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.15,1:03:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"Now that you're married,\Nyou're no longer one of us."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.52,1:03:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"Consider yourself a part of Queens,\Nand stay there even after you die."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.03,1:03:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,"Don't dare come back\Nor set foot into our house."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.95,1:03:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So speaking of which...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.67,1:03:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Div...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.71,1:03:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to interrupt,\Nbut you're going to be late...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.34,1:03:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,for your meeting with Mr. Hermann.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.47,1:03:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I need to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.26,1:03:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an important dinner today.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.01,1:03:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.72,1:03:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll text you the rest of the conversation,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.43,1:03:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so please save my number.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.57,1:03:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll visit you sometime soon.\N- Really? Would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.70,1:03:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit we've been distant\Nafter Hyun-woo got married.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.12,1:03:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you got us a building.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.54,1:03:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A building?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.54,1:04:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the one in our town.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.62,1:04:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I purchase a building there?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.25,1:04:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you did. You told me to\Nget one when you got married.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.09,1:04:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you using that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.17,1:04:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.22,1:04:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.64,1:04:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I do the cleaning and repairing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.72,1:04:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I do everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.93,1:04:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about the building,\Nsince I have it under control.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.40,1:04:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, why did your in-laws visit?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.44,1:04:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.15,1:04:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She mentioned how I didn't\Nattend her father's 60th.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.86,1:04:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So she came to nitpick?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.57,1:04:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She said no.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.70,1:04:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.37,1:04:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She said marriage was like\Nturning the AC on in the summer.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.37,1:04:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.13,1:04:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You never agree on the temperature.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.67,1:04:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.23,1:05:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.94,1:05:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where is Mr. Hermann?\N- Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.77,1:05:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He went to see his baby\Ndaughter because she flipped over.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.15,1:05:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He ditched this meeting just\Nbecause his baby flipped over?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.78,1:05:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a family guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.07,1:05:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be why he divorced\Nfour times and had a baby at 60.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.37,1:05:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How irritating.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.20,1:05:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I even brought the floor plan,\Nsince he wanted to see it first.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.20,1:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is actually better.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.04,1:05:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, he already has a picture in mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.63,1:05:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that beforehand\Nwould give you an advantage.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.63,1:05:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he want?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.30,1:05:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You're back?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.18,1:05:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you went home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.05,1:05:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have more documents to look over.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.68,1:05:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- You can go home.\N- Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.27,1:05:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Secretary Na told me earlier...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.23,1:05:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,that Ms. Hong had a dinner appointment.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.86,1:05:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She said Ms. Hong was\Nmeeting with Mr. Yoon Eun-sung,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.78,1:05:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and might come home late, so sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.49,1:05:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's safe for you to go\Nhome instead of staying here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.16,1:06:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's she meeting again?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.99,1:06:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hercyna wants two floors.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.71,1:06:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Two floors?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.00,1:06:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need a fancy staircase around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.50,1:06:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.13,1:06:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't be a simple renovation.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.09,1:06:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to change the\Nstructure and get it approved.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.80,1:06:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. He'll make that suggestion\Nand choose whoever gets it done first.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.51,1:06:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.97,1:06:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ridiculous...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.64,1:06:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but only I know this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.73,1:06:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.78,1:06:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, did you hear about your siblings\Nvisiting Ms. Hong earlier today?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.95,1:06:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who?\N- Your sister and brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.79,1:06:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Secretary Na just told me about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.04,1:06:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.01,1:07:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat before they get soggy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.97,1:07:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. "I know it's tough. Dot, dot, dot."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.85,1:07:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"But you still can't get a divorce."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.27,1:07:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"Can you reconsider it for my sake?"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.06,1:07:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would she do that? She barely knows you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.90,1:07:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just eat your udon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.65,1:07:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you mention\Ncleaning the building to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.86,1:07:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so shocked.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.53,1:07:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How didn't she know about her own building?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.83,1:07:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this similar to how I forgot...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.70,1:07:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,about the $10 I left...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.08,1:07:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,in my winter coat?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.50,1:07:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what owning...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.75,1:07:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- a building is to them...?\N- Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.25,1:07:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"Whatever the reason for your divorce may be,"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.01,1:07:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"I believe Hyun-woo is to blame,"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.72,1:07:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"so could you please be\Nunderstanding this once,"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.72,1:07:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"and not get a divorce? Crying emote."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.14,1:07:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sending it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.32,1:07:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Hyun-woo!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.32,1:07:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.40,1:07:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do I do?\N- Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.99,1:08:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Yes, I met her.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.74,1:08:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think I did?\NTo tell her not to divorce you,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.16,1:08:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but she was too busy,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.08,1:08:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,so I texted her instead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.33,1:08:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.96,1:08:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not separating.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.46,1:08:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did they reconcile?\N- Did you reconcile?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.59,1:08:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she just doesn't know that he wants...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.30,1:08:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- a divorce.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.38,1:08:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He never brought it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.51,1:08:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.97,1:08:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.23,1:08:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.90,1:08:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Power Off{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.50,1:08:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.00,1:08:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.67,1:08:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.84,1:09:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of person...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.51,1:09:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,is your husband?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.76,1:09:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That was random.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.01,1:09:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You were always cold and suspicious of others,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.43,1:09:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so I was curious about the person...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.89,1:09:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you chose to marry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.02,1:09:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.02,1:09:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like you're hoping I'd bad-mouth him,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.94,1:09:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're wrong. He's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.65,1:09:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw how he jumped in to\Nsave me in that dangerous moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.62,1:09:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.83,1:09:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him hesitating.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.20,1:09:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He hesitated...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.91,1:09:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,to save you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.71,1:09:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.13,1:09:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.64,1:09:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The number you have dialed is not available...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.98,1:10:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the difference between you two.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.23,1:10:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You were watching him at that moment,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.78,1:10:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but he was watching me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.87,1:10:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually believe he loves you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.95,1:10:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.83,1:10:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what love means to you,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.04,1:10:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but to me, it's not about being\Nhappy and whispering sweet nothings.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.71,1:10:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Love is when...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.59,1:10:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you endure the pain together.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.34,1:10:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When you choose to stay instead of running away.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.35,1:10:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if they have a debt,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.85,1:10:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,or something more than that,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.85,1:10:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,you still stick together.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.76,1:10:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's love,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.48,1:10:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's doing just that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.03,1:10:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That was lengthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.47,1:10:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.53,1:10:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,People tend to ramble when they're unsure.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.53,1:10:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look confident.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.49,1:11:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.78,1:11:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.91,1:11:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.96,1:11:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.92,1:11:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in had a lot to drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.17,1:11:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She drank?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.47,1:11:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.60,1:11:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hae-in.\N- Leave her alone. She's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.06,1:12:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She sleeps when she's drunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.36,1:12:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.61,1:12:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been sleeping the whole time,\Nso give her ten more minutes,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.08,1:12:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,or I'll bring her in later,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.45,1:12:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can wait inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.62,1:12:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How much alcohol did you give her?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.79,1:12:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.96,1:12:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.34,1:12:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't usually drink,\Nbut she can hold her liquor,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.55,1:12:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so how much did you give her, for her to be...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.72,1:12:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,this drunk?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.64,1:12:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I mixed alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.70,1:12:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sleep, because you're too noisy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.91,1:12:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. Go home safely.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.95,1:13:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Sleep well.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.12,1:13:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- See you tomorrow evening.\N- Why would she...?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.84,1:13:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.67,1:13:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you guys met with Mr. Hermann today,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.01,1:13:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,so what's tomorrow for?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.30,1:13:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hermann didn't show up today.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.24,1:13:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just us two,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.39,1:13:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and we drank...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.02,1:13:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,by ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.73,1:13:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Don't forget to drink\Norange juice in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.57,1:13:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your hangover cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.24,1:13:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.72,1:13:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.74,1:13:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bye.\N- Goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.20,1:13:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take good care of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.37,1:13:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mr. Oh.\N- Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.58,1:13:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take him home safely.\NHe seems to be very drunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.55,1:13:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems very out of it,\Nso walk him to his door.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.71,1:13:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.88,1:13:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.69,1:14:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you suddenly drink so much?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.28,1:14:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it was unlike me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.03,1:14:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to try new things.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.00,1:14:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so unfair.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.00,1:14:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I lived differently from others so\NI could live a long, healthy life.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.63,1:14:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But look at me now. It was all useless.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.72,1:14:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to speak my mind,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.30,1:14:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,do everything I want,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.60,1:14:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and kill those who deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.07,1:14:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the last one?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.70,1:15:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.32,1:15:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,every single scumbag who betrays...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.49,1:15:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and stabs me in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.12,1:15:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.71,1:15:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I do commit murder,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.88,1:15:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just need to attend trial\Na few times before I die...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.76,1:15:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,in three months.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.34,1:15:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. You could be my attorney.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.18,1:15:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, give me that. Let's go inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.40,1:15:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a knack for\Nsaying such terrifying things.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.33,1:15:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.08,1:15:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'd never betray me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.25,1:15:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.34,1:15:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.76,1:16:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.27,1:16:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,your phone was turned off.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.31,1:16:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.40,1:16:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.77,1:16:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.44,1:16:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I must've left it in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.90,1:16:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In the car?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.36,1:16:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on in. I'll get your phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.62,1:16:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Oh, have you left? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.96,1:16:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.09,1:16:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.81,1:16:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What? It's turned off.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.31,1:16:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.89,1:17:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing?\N- I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.98,1:17:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.81,1:17:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,am I...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.73,1:17:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,doing right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.78,1:17:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.44,1:17:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,you found...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.11,1:17:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,your phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.45,1:17:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It could've been...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.41,1:17:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,a hassle to get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.38,1:17:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wasn't I...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.88,1:18:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,confident?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.05,1:18:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.76,1:18:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.81,1:18:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.20,1:18:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.41,1:18:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to try...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.78,1:18:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,new things.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.94,1:19:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Sanssouci Palace, Potsdam, Germany\NThree Years Ago{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.75,1:19:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say this place had no worries?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.67,1:19:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sans souci" in French means "carefree."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.88,1:19:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.47,1:19:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How could such a place exist?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.18,1:19:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know "The Happy Prince"?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.55,1:19:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The prince who made a swallow poke out his eyes?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.02,1:19:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.06,1:19:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The prince used to live in this palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.07,1:19:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I only realized one thing\Nafter reading that book...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.57,1:19:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,as a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.99,1:19:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"You'll always suffer away from home."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.66,1:19:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the prince probably missed his home.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.20,1:19:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He left home only to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.00,1:20:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He gave away his gems and eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.34,1:20:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.30,1:20:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he's the "happy prince."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.22,1:20:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Please. He wasn't happy. He\Njust changed before his death.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.14,1:20:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We should stay true to ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.26,1:20:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and not act out of character\Njust because we're dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.99,1:20:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to build something.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.25,1:20:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A cancer support center\Nthat aids employees' families.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.62,1:20:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.79,1:20:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to offer financial\Nhelp to their families?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.96,1:20:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.84,1:20:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,For efficiency, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.92,1:20:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.51,1:20:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine if your family member has cancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.80,1:20:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you focus on work?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.30,1:20:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Probably not.\N- Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.64,1:21:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you wouldn't be able to sell your products.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.39,1:21:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be my loss,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.31,1:21:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'd cry in the toilet about\Nhow you're in need of money.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.65,1:21:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your makeup would run,\Nyour eyes would be swollen.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.85,1:21:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd only bring down our\Ndepartment store's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.97,1:21:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.95,1:21:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.66,1:21:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,to help others out of goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.74,1:21:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all about the efficiency\Nand the financial aspect.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.04,1:21:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.11,1:21:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}- Are you going to bed?\N- Let's do it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.78,1:22:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}It was because I was scared. That's\Nwhy my heart was racing so much.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.04,1:22:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Now that I've been cured,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.50,1:22:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}you're going to betray me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.54,1:22:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Watch out!{\i0}
